'''Sweet Aphrodite''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] introduced in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Valentine Gals (Gacha Event)|Valentine Gals]] Gacha. She is a variant of [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Radiant Aphrodite]].
{{Cat Info
|ID = 587
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Sweet Aphrodite
|name2 = Chocoladite
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Chocoladite''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit has use both as a generalist, thanks to her range, and as a specialist for killing backliners of the traits she targets; [[Professor A.|Professor A]], for example, can be disposed of very quickly if there are enemies in front. She isn't as good as Aphrodite in terms of generalist usage, due to her lower damage, but she is more versatile when it comes to traits she can counter.

She is generally better against Red enemies, especially due to how much Dark enemies can usually push, but she counters some Dark enemies well, like [[Le'noir]]. Given a good stepping stone, she can even hit [[Director Kurosawah]].

However, Sweet Aphrodite faces competition as a specialist. Although there are some Red/Black rangers, the rest of them are notoriously aggressive pushers, which mean they can get into her blind spot easily, such as [[Razorback]] and buffed [[Shy Boy]]s. On another note, it is recommended to bring [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|Crowd-Controllers]] in order to support Sweet Aphrodite, or merely use other short-ranged attackers.

{{Job|Classification = Sniper & Nuker}}

